  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A yellow sad-face icon on the viral load results form, placed beside the result to flag an unsuppressed viral load.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "أيقونة وجه حزين أصفر على استمارة نتائج الحمل الفيروسي، موضوعة بجانب النتيجة للإشارة إلى حمل فيروسي غير مكبوت.",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "病毒载量结果表上的黄色哭脸图标，置于结果旁，用于标示病毒载量未被抑制。",
      "lang": "zh",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
